# Cliks Business OS — Payments Section Complete API Reference

This comprehensive API documentation covers all 5 sub-modules located under the `/payments` route in **Cliks Business OS**:

base url :- "<https://cliks.beta-softnet.com/api>"

- **Sub-Module 1: Transactions & Cash Flow Engine** (`/payments/transaction`)
- **Sub-Module 2: People Network & Escrow** (`/payments/people`)
- **Sub-Module 3: Purpose Wallets & Goal Segregation** (`/payments/wallet` & `/payments/segregation`)
- **Sub-Module 4: Split & Collect (Splitwise)** (`/payments/split-collect`)
- **Sub-Module 5: Payment Planner & Scheduled Outlays** (`/payments/planner` & `/payments/plan`)

---

## Global Authentication & Headers

All requests require Bearer token authentication in the HTTP header:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>
Content-Type: application/json
```

Standard Error Response Envelope:

```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "message": "Detailed error description",
  "code": "BAD_REQUEST | NOT_FOUND | UNAUTHORIZED | INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR"
}
```

