# Sub-Module 1: Transactions & Cash Flow Engine (`/payments/transaction`)

**UI Route:** `/payments/transaction`  
**Frontend Component:** `src/pages/payments/Transaction.jsx` & `src/pages/BusinessPayments.jsx`  
**Backend Routes:** `/api/v1/payments/*` & `/api/v1/transactions/*`

---

### 1.1 Receive Customer Payment / Receipt

- **Method & Route:** `POST /api/v1/payments/receive` (Alias: `POST /api/v1/payments/customer-receipts`)
- **Description:** Records an incoming settlement from a customer against an existing invoice or as an on-account receipt, adjusting receivables and bank account ledger balances.

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "customer_name": "Acme Retail Ltd",
  "invoice_id": 1042,
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "paidAmount": 15000.00,
  "payment_mode": "UPI",
  "reference_number": "UPI-984729184",
  "account_id": 1,
  "notes": "Settlement of invoice INV-1042"
}
```

#### Response (201 Created)

```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Payment received successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 85,
    "paidAmount": 15000.00,
    "amount": 15000.00,
    "customer_name": "Acme Retail Ltd",
    "invoice_id": 1042,
    "status": "completed",
    "reconciliation_status": "matched"
  }
}
```

---

