  "supplier_name": "Apex Fabricators",
  "purchase_id": "PUR-2026-089",
  "amount": 28500.00,
  "payment_mode": "Bank Transfer",
  "reference_number": "NEFT-88492041",
  "account_id": 2,
  "notes": "Settlement for PO #108 raw materials"
}
```

#### Response (201 Created)

```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Payment to supplier recorded successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 92,
    "amount": 28500.00
  }
}
```

