### 2.12 Financial Groups Workflow

- **List Groups:** `GET /api/v1/people/groups`
- **Create Group:** `POST /api/v1/people/groups`

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Store Renovation Group",
    "currency": "INR",
    "description": "Shared expense pool for flagship store renovation"
  }
  ```

