- **Update Group:** `PUT /api/v1/people/groups/:id`
- **Delete Group:** `DELETE /api/v1/people/groups/:id`
- **Invite Member:** `POST /api/v1/people/groups/:id/members`

  ```json
  {
    "email": "partner@bnxmail.com",
    "role": "member"
  }
  ```

- **Remove Member:** `DELETE /api/v1/people/groups/:id/members/:memberId`
- **Add Group Transaction:** `POST /api/v1/people/groups/:id/transactions`

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Architectural Blueprint Fee",
    "amount": 40000.00,
    "category": "Design",
    "split_type": "equal"
  }
  ```

- **Delete Group Transaction:** `DELETE /api/v1/people/groups/:id/transactions/:txId`
- **Set Private Member Note:** `POST /api/v1/people/groups/:id/members/:memberId/private-note`

  ```json
  {
    "note": "Private internal accounting note"
  }
  ```

- **Delete Private Member Note:** `DELETE /api/v1/people/groups/:id/members/:memberId/private-note`

